/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (I acknowledge the transformative impact of digital technology on our society, presenting unparalleled opportunity while also posing serious cybersecurity risks. In an era where digital transactions, online communication, and artificial intelligence are integral to daily life, safeguarding our cyber ecosystem is not just a necessity but a national priority. Our legal framework must evolve dynamically to protect both digital infrastructure and individual rights from emerging threats. The rapidly evolving cyber threat landscape, including deepfake technology, misinformation campaigns, financial fraud, and data breaches, necessitates continuous legal reforms. It is imperative that we develop stringent regulatory mechanisms to curb the misuse of digital platforms, prevent cyber exploitation, and counter disinformation that threatens national security and social harmony.)
/E (I acknowledge the transformative impact of digital technology on our society, presenting unparalleled opportunity while also posing serious cybersecurity risks. In an era where digital transactions, online communication, and artificial intelligence are integral to daily life, safeguarding our cyber ecosystem is not just a necessity but a national priority. Our legal framework must evolve dynamically to protect both digital infrastructure and individual rights from emerging threats. The rapidly evolving cyber threat landscape, including deepfake technology, misinformation campaigns, financial fraud, and data breaches, necessitates continuous legal reforms. It is imperative that we develop stringent regulatory mechanisms to curb the misuse of digital platforms, prevent cyber exploitation, and counter disinformation that threatens national security and social harmony.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
