/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This book aims to serve as a comprehensive guide to cybercrimes and the legal recourses available in India to address them. It explores various forms of online abuse, including harassment, identity theft, cyberstalking, and privacy violations, with a particular focus on gender-based cybercrimes. Additionally, the book delves into the relevant provisions under Indian laws, such as the Information Technology Act, 2000 offering practical insights on how victims can seek justice. By raising awareness and highlighting legal protections, this guide seeks to empower individuals to navigate the digital landscape more safely and confidently.)
/E (This book aims to serve as a comprehensive guide to cybercrimes and the legal recourses available in India to address them. It explores various forms of online abuse, including harassment, identity theft, cyberstalking, and privacy violations, with a particular focus on gender-based cybercrimes. Additionally, the book delves into the relevant provisions under Indian laws, such as the Information Technology Act, 2000 offering practical insights on how victims can seek justice. By raising awareness and highlighting legal protections, this guide seeks to empower individuals to navigate the digital landscape more safely and confidently.)
