794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Ministry of Home Affairs has launched the Cyber Crime Reporting Portal to facilitate the reporting of cyber offenses.  Website: www.cybercrime.gov.in Steps to file a complaint: a.     Visit the portal and click on "File a Complaint." b.     Select the category of the complaint \(e.g., women/child-related crimes or other crimes\). c.     Provide necessary information, including your contact details, nature of the crime, and any evidence \(screenshots, emails, chats\). d.     Submit the complaint and note the complaint reference number for future  follow-up.)
/E (The Ministry of Home Affairs has launched the Cyber Crime Reporting Portal to facilitate the reporting of cyber offenses.  Website: www.cybercrime.gov.in Steps to file a complaint: a.     Visit the portal and click on "File a Complaint." b.     Select the category of the complaint \(e.g., women/child-related crimes or other crimes\). c.     Provide necessary information, including your contact details, nature of the crime, and any evidence \(screenshots, emails, chats\). d.     Submit the complaint and note the complaint reference number for future  follow-up.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
795 0 obj
<<
