endobj
796 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (For crimes related to women or children \(e.g., harassment, blackmail, abuse\), reports can be made anonymously through the Cyber Crime Portal. The government ensures confidentiality and sensitivity in handling such cases. ii.  Victims can also lodge a First Information Report \(FIR\) at the nearest police station or approach the local Cyber Crime Police Station if available.  iii.  Complaint can also be made to the National Commission for Women for cybercrimes against women at ncw.nic.in or sent through post. )
/E (For crimes related to women or children \(e.g., harassment, blackmail, abuse\), reports can be made anonymously through the Cyber Crime Portal. The government ensures confidentiality and sensitivity in handling such cases. ii.  Victims can also lodge a First Information Report \(FIR\) at the nearest police station or approach the local Cyber Crime Police Station if available.  iii.  Complaint can also be made to the National Commission for Women for cybercrimes against women at ncw.nic.in or sent through post. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
